//RS /// D-PROCESS-SESSION1=A (#1181): `.terminal()` is the one opt-in for a
//RS /// terminal-backed session, and it lives on the same `ProcessSpec`. Argv
//RS /// execution with no terminal stays the default. Unix run/spawn use a real PTY;
//RS /// pipeline stages reject terminal specs rather than coercing them to pipes.
